  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Vectors II: dividing a line internally</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Core 2.6: Find AP and the position vector of a point dividing a line segment internally in a given ratio in three dimensions.</p><p id="edition">Core</p><p id="provenance">This question is adapted from Example 2 in Section D of Chapter 9 of Instone, S., Ling, J., Scruton, P., Shilton, S. and West, H., SMP AS/A2 Mathematics: Core 4 for AQA, Cambridge University Press, 2005: a ratio instead of a fraction, a mast cable context in Kitui, new numbers, randomised over a curated list, with named and follow-through feedback.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Core Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
